  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The foci of a hyperbola are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and its eccentricity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. A tangent, perpendicular to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>, is drawn at a point in the first quadrant on the hyperbola. If the intercepts made by the tangent on the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axes are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> respectively, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>|</mo></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given equation of hyperbola is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The tangent is perpendicular to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>.</p><p>Slope of tangent is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Equation of tangent, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Equation of tangent is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>( <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Tangent is in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mtext>st&#160;</mtext></msup></math> quadrant<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Converting the equation into intercept form:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mstyle></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
